{
    "title": "Holafly eSIM Prepaid Card",
    "description": "Holafly is your best travel companion. Stay connected wherever you go with Holafly's eSIM cards and enjoy Unlimited Mobile Internet Data plans worldwide.\r\n\r\nWhat is an eSIM card?\r\n\r\nAn eSIM card provides mobile data like a regular SIM card but is digital and international, eliminating expensive roaming fees. You can use an eSIM alongside your local SIM card to receive calls or WhatsApp messages with your regular number.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Holafly?\r\n\r\nHolafly is your go-to international prepaid eSIM provider, offering Unlimited phone Data with quick, easy connectivity.\r\n\r\nWith Holafly\u2019s eSIM card, you get:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e Connection Anywhere, Anytime \r\nEnjoy fast, reliable mobile Internet access during your international travels in over 200 destinations, with multiple plan options, with unlimited and limited data, that can be adapted to the days of your trip. Connect to the internet within minutes and enhance your travel experience with our digital SIM card.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Cost-Effective Connectivity \r\nTravel without the fear of extra expenses. Holafly offers prepaid eSIMs for travel with Unlimited Data coverage in over 200 destinations, including Europe, Mexico, China, Turkey, Japan, and the USA. You can also purchase limited data plans for other destinations and top-ups for extra phone data.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2 Easy Installation & Activation\r\nPurchase your eSIM through the Holafly App with credit card or PayPal. Receive your eSIM in your email within just seconds. Install your eSIM seamlessly through the Holaly App with the help of our guides, videos, and offline content. Activate your data package at your destination. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca Data Plan Insights\r\nTrack your eSIM data usage, activation, and expiration dates through the app. Top-up your prepaid eSIMs anytime you need extra data.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Universal Compatibility\r\nHolafly's e SIM works with all eSIM-compatible smartphones, including Samsung Galaxy S23, Oppo Find X5, Xiaomi 13, Google Pixel 8, and more. Check our compatibility guide for details.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb3 Choose your local payment method \r\nPeople from Belgium, the Netherlands, Portugal, Finland, and France will now be able to buy with their local payment method. More countries will soon join the list.\r\n\r\nHow to Buy an eSIM plan?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Choose Your Plan\r\nDownload the app and choose your destination, select a plan according to your travel schedule, and continue to checkout (you can save your payment information for later purchases). You\u2019ll receive your eSIM via email in seconds and can log in to the app to manage and set up your card.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Set Up Your eSIM\r\nInstall and activate your eSIM through the app. Log in using your email or your Google account (make sure it matches the one you used for purchase). Alternatively, use QR or manual codes for setup, also sent by email. You can find step-by-step guides in our app.\r\n\r\n\u26a1 Activate Your Data\r\nOnce you finish installing your e SIM, activate data roaming and say goodbye to relying on WiFi. Data will only activate once at your destination. Track data usage in real-time within the app of all your available eSIMs for travel. That\u2019s it! Start enjoying internet connectivity with a 4G connection, LTE, and 5G connection without needing WiFi for all your trips.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcac 24/7 Support\r\nNeed help? Contact our multilingual support team anytime. We\u2019re here to assist with the eSIM setup and any other questions.\r\n\r\nEmbark on your adventures with Holafly \u2013 made with love by people who love to travel. Stay connected worldwide\u2014download the Holafly App now!\r\n\r\n(One-button installation for Samsung devices is available.)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Holafly is your best travel companion. Stay connected wherever you go with Holafly&#39;s eSIM cards and enjoy Unlimited Mobile Internet Data plans worldwide.<br><br>What is an eSIM card?<br><br>An eSIM card provides mobile data like a regular SIM card but is digital and international, eliminating expensive roaming fees. You can use an eSIM alongside your local SIM card to receive calls or WhatsApp messages with your regular number.<br><br>Why Choose Holafly?<br><br>Holafly is your go-to international prepaid eSIM provider, offering Unlimited phone Data with quick, easy connectivity.<br><br>With Holafly\u2019s eSIM card, you get:<br><br>\ud83c\udf0e Connection Anywhere, Anytime <br>Enjoy fast, reliable mobile Internet access during your international travels in over 200 destinations, with multiple plan options, with unlimited and limited data, that can be adapted to the days of your trip. Connect to the internet within minutes and enhance your travel experience with our digital SIM card.<br><br>\ud83d\udcb0 Cost-Effective Connectivity <br>Travel without the fear of extra expenses. Holafly offers prepaid eSIMs for travel with Unlimited Data coverage in over 200 destinations, including Europe, Mexico, China, Turkey, Japan, and the USA. You can also purchase limited data plans for other destinations and top-ups for extra phone data.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf2 Easy Installation &amp; Activation<br>Purchase your eSIM through the Holafly App with credit card or PayPal. Receive your eSIM in your email within just seconds. Install your eSIM seamlessly through the Holaly App with the help of our guides, videos, and offline content. Activate your data package at your destination. <br><br>\ud83d\udcca Data Plan Insights<br>Track your eSIM data usage, activation, and expiration dates through the app. Top-up your prepaid eSIMs anytime you need extra data.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 Universal Compatibility<br>Holafly&#39;s e SIM works with all eSIM-compatible smartphones, including Samsung Galaxy S23, Oppo Find X5, Xiaomi 13, Google Pixel 8, and more. Check our compatibility guide for details.<br><br>\ud83d\udcb3 Choose your local payment method <br>People from Belgium, the Netherlands, Portugal, Finland, and France will now be able to buy with their local payment method. More countries will soon join the list.<br><br>How to Buy an eSIM plan?<br><br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Choose Your Plan<br>Download the app and choose your destination, select a plan according to your travel schedule, and continue to checkout (you can save your payment information for later purchases). You\u2019ll receive your eSIM via email in seconds and can log in to the app to manage and set up your card.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Set Up Your eSIM<br>Install and activate your eSIM through the app. Log in using your email or your Google account (make sure it matches the one you used for purchase). Alternatively, use QR or manual codes for setup, also sent by email. You can find step-by-step guides in our app.<br><br>\u26a1 Activate Your Data<br>Once you finish installing your e SIM, activate data roaming and say goodbye to relying on WiFi. Data will only activate once at your destination. Track data usage in real-time within the app of all your available eSIMs for travel. That\u2019s it! Start enjoying internet connectivity with a 4G connection, LTE, and 5G connection without needing WiFi for all your trips.<br><br>\ud83d\udcac 24/7 Support<br>Need help? Contact our multilingual support team anytime. We\u2019re here to assist with the eSIM setup and any other questions.<br><br>Embark on your adventures with Holafly \u2013 made with love by people who love to travel. Stay connected worldwide\u2014download the Holafly App now!<br><br>(One-button installation for Samsung devices is available.)",
